      "text": "[7:05AM] \n\n#LagBadagryExpWay\n#Mile2\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nMovement from Second Rainbow to Mile 2 oke down to Otto wharf (inward and outward) is still in good shape this morning.\n\nMovement from Mile 2 underneath the  bridge down to Durbar junction and Mazamaza looks  good.\n\nLikewise the return journey from Mazamaza  through Ecomog down to Alaba suru \n\nAlakija environment is still in good shape both inward mile 2,  Abule ado,  Festac and  Navy town.\n\nThe four cardinal angles of Apple junction are very much in good shape.\n#FollowLASTMA",
